@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #2C3E50
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.4

skinparam activity {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BorderColor #2C3E50
    BorderThickness 1.4
    DiamondBackgroundColor #FEF9E7
    DiamondBorderColor #2C3E50
}

skinparam swimlane {
    BorderColor #7F8C8D
    BorderThickness 1.5
    TitleBackgroundColor #EBF5FB
    TitleFontColor #2C3E50
    TitleFontStyle bold
    TitleFontSize 12
}

title Aktivitetsdiagram - Dynamisk Spring IoC DI Swimlane Flow (Route -> BaseController -> BaseService -> BaseRepository -> Hibernate Entity / DTO)

|Klient / Terapeut (Next.js Route & BFF)|
start
:Bruger udfører handling i UI
(Onboarding, Booking, Handshake, Journal eller PCL-5);
:Next.js BFF validerer OIDC Session / JWT mod **Keycloak IAM**
og videresender HTTP Request til ""/api/v1/..."" med Bearer JWT;

|Controller Swimlane (BaseController<E, D, ID>)|
:Spring DispatcherServlet router kaldet til domæne-controller
(""ClinicPlatformController"", ""AppointmentController"",
""JournalController"", ""PsychotraumatologyController"", ""UserController"");
:Controller delegerer **udelukkende** til sin generiske
Spring IoC-injicerede ""BaseService<E, D, UUID>"";

|Service Swimlane (BaseService<E, D, ID> @Transactional)|
:Åbner ""@Transactional"" kontekst & resolver generiske typer
""Class<E>"" og ""Class<D>"" via ""GenericTypeResolver"";
:Mapper automatisk ""D (BaseDTO<UUID>) <-> E (BaseEntity<UUID>)""
og afvikler registrerede ""CrudInterceptor<E, UUID>""-hooks
(""beforeCreate"" / ""beforeUpdate"" / ""beforeDelete"");

if (Operationstype?) then (Klinisk Profil / CVR / Ydelse / Handshake)
    :Validerer CVR, profilfelter eller samtykkeperiode
    i ""ClinicPlatformService"";
elseif (Aftalebooking & Timefold AI?) then (Booking / Ombooking)
    :Kontrollerer overlap & AI-slots i ""AppointmentService"";
    if (Overlappende aftale findes?) then (Ja - Konflikt)
        #FADBD8:Kaster **HTTP 409 Conflict**;
        |Klient / Terapeut (Next.js Route & BFF)|
        :Viser fejlbesked & foreslår ledige Timefold-tider;
        stop
    else (Nej - Ledig tid)
    endif
elseif (Journal eller PCL-5 Traumetest?) then (Journal / Klinisk Notat / PCL-5)
    :Validerer adgangsrettigheder, Handshake-status &
    privatlivsfilter (""INTERNAL_MEDICAL_NOTES"")
    i ""JournalService"" / ""PsychotraumatologyService"";
endif

|Repository Swimlane (BaseRepository<E, ID>)|
:Udfører typesikret kald eller dynamisk ""JpaSpecificationExecutor<E>""
filtrering (""_like"", ""_gt"", ""_lt"", ""_gte"", ""_lte"", sortering & paginering)
via Spring Data JPA ""BaseRepository<E, UUID>"";

|Hibernate ORM / PostgreSQL / JGit / Redis / Kafka|
#D5F5E3:Hibernate ""Session"" / ""EntityManager"" persisterer eller indlæser
""E extends BaseEntity<UUID>"" i **PostgreSQL** (`business-db`);
if (Kræver revisionsspor eller cache/event?) then (Ja)
    :Committer Markdown-snapshot til **JGit** (SHA-1 hash),
    opdaterer/invaliderer **Redis L2 Cache**
    & publicerer **Kafka** domæne-event;
else (Nej)
endif

|Service Swimlane (BaseService<E, D, ID> @Transactional)|
:Afvikler ""afterCreate"" / ""afterUpdate"" / ""afterDelete""
på ""CrudInterceptor<E, UUID>"" og transformerer ""toDto(E)"";

|Controller Swimlane (BaseController<E, D, ID>)|
:Pakker resultat i ""ResponseEntity<D>"" (HTTP 200 / 201 / 204);

|Klient / Terapeut (Next.js Route & BFF)|
:Modtager JSON-respons og opdaterer reaktivt UI;
stop
@enduml
